%N A390213 Number of divisors d of n such that d^(n/d) == d (mod (n/d)).
%H A390213 Antti Karttunen, <a href="/A390213/b390213.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 1..10000</a>
%t A390213 a[n_] := DivisorSum[n, 1 &, PowerMod[#, n/#, n/#] == Mod[#, n/#] &]; Array[a, 100] (* _Amiram Eldar_, Nov 06 2025 *)
%o A390213 (PARI) A390213(n) = sumdiv(n,d,!(((d^(n/d))-d)%(n/d))); \\ _Antti Karttunen_, Nov 24 2026
